g", "id": "1654516845847706", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_1654516849181039_8083947904987662776_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dLg-XRn938Q7kNvwHxDPA9&_nc_oc=Adoc0X0bxj-4hU_R2beV6dO_3xPuRfoiifnamOKti4rQLIV27_xcedv6TaTnHJoHel4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI1cYFR30CPWrG95aB8MEdmUUuJdHM4MujOBUN_c3FmAQ&oe=6AB92E46"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1-seat.png", "id": "1583885329746068", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_1583885336412734_1232291410291248272_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y7ViLQhnSsQQ7kNvwE0tRZN&_nc_oc=Adp8p0i9wL5uzRFN_K3wnaafGA4cq6qDERIIgMyO390FD74yjzl2FzlNok-WYn6gVPU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLR0jHxrDexibmtokmgYtMyDG4z94Vh2Pl5hp7WqcfXsA&oe=6AB925A9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-overview.png", "id": "1957514004914617", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1957514008247950_2769593181572890106_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=esALId1ifkwQ7kNvwHLzuOn&_nc_oc=Adq0-jO6lEdPPjnoYWo2jc0DIvWCDiiaRJ5P8ZmdAdkQsRr6AUevf9dNasJ23aKux9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIi6DzkxtqodSBOn2w7cT0hyguhGkPiA6No_sLO7jOleQ&oe=6AB9119E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-night.png", "id": "2751702535216160", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_2751702538549493_3801895166710475780_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zw_15A73RNkQ7kNvwENL3Bi&_nc_oc=Adoxkcv_H8qwiJBQCoEN3c8Asj_d3Bw0-tPRMzJI4KhcKKjIR7slL_kIAUfd8T0w20w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKIC6wJdEPar9bsVJZlj60vFZW2ErKC5GanfOg8zNbdzw&oe=6AB93ABF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-landscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "1020015244080350", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_1020015247413683_7470808261870336801_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rj12LtEKvlkQ7kNvwG_plcj&_nc_oc=AdrucIOCKwDcxfE31RFu9B3Ptytclq1EBEjGeBg234ROl2Lh4W8yLPLms74IuNUj6cQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKjUwZkn2uIyR7muvnwkQFP7cWAp-fN2olSt2LOsDOfcQ&oe=6AB90E83"}, "display_name": "Mahjong Table VR", "keywords": ["mahjong", "tabletop", "multiplayer", "singapore", "tiles"], "long_description": "Sit at a real mahjong table without leaving your room. Mahjong Table VR is full four-player Singapore mahjong with real physics: you pick tiles off the wall, rack them, and throw your discards onto the felt.\n\nPlay solo against three bots, or host a table and have up to three friends join from a phone or laptop with a room code. They don't need a headset and joining is free. Voice chat is built in, so the table talk comes with it.\n\nSingapore scoring, done properly: flowers and animals with instant payouts, rob-the-kong, sacred discard, dealer repeats, prevailing and seat winds, chicken hand toggle, adjustable minimum tai and caps. Stakes are counted in chips.\n\n- Full Singapore rules with a proper tai table\n- Real tile physics: wash, stack, rack, throw\n- Solo vs bots with three difficulty levels\n- Up to 4 players: friends join free from any browser, no headset needed\n- Built-in voice chat at the table\n- Mixed reality mode: put the table in your actual room\n- Play with controllers or bare hands\n- English and Chinese\n\nOne hand takes about ten minutes. Pull up a chair.", "short_description": "The only real four-player mahjong in VR. Singapore rules, real tile physics, and friends join free from any browser. "}]}, "developer_name": "Graphikate", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mahjong-vr.pages.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GRAPHIKATE PRIVATE LIMITED", "support_website_url": "https://graphikate.com/", "website_url": "https://mahjongtable.fun/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_ta